# public key (to secure APIs etc)
Server init.

# generate keys
>> keys := Polokelo-e-sireletsehileng etsa-linotlolo.

# private (secret) key
>> sk := keys ea-pele.

# public key
>> pk := keys ea-ho-qetela.

# sign a message
>> sig := Polokelo-e-sireletsehileng saena: ['abc'] ka: sk.

Sephetho ngola: sig bolelele, mola-o-mocha.